<title>ARGENTINA: Mainly fine weather in Argentine crop zones.</title>
<headline>Mainly fine weather in Argentine crop zones.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine farmers were finishing off their wheat harvest Wednesday amid mostly fine weather, traders said.</p>
<p>While some showers were forecast in a few areas, the weather is favorable for developing maize, soybeans and sunflower, traders said.</p>
<p>The government's Meteorological Service forecast warm, overcast weather. There was a possibility of late storms in western Buenos Aires, La Pampa and northern Santa Fe. Weather Services Corp said highs would range from 80-90 F (27-32 C).</p>
<p>((--Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
